<table style="margin: auto; width: 100%;  background-color: #ffffff;  border-radius: 5px;">
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 10px 30px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 30px;">
      Hello {{userAddrShort}},
      <br><br>
      Your liquidity has received a new swap order. The buyer wants to swap <b>{{quoteSize}} {{market.quote}}</b> token{{pluralStr}} ({{>printTokenIDs ids=swap.takerIds}}) for <b>{{amount}} {{market.base}}</b>.
      <br>
      <br>
      <div {{> alertStyle }}>
        <div style="padding: 5px 10px;">Review the order and make payment to the buyer. Once the buyer confirms the payment and releases the order, {{quoteSize}} {{market.quote}} token{{pluralStr}} will be transferred to you.</div>
        <div style="padding: 5px 10px; border-top: 1px dashed #f7f7f7; font-weight: bold;">This order will expire in <span style="color: #d34f4f;">{{cancelAt}}</span></div>
      </div>
      <br>
      {{> primaryButton this }}
      <br>
      <br>
      Love, <br>
      {{app}} Team
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>


